  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then, for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, the least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
